ext/*
# ...except GINI's own apps. Upstream POX ignores ext/ as the user's scratch space, but here
# ext/gini/ IS the product: under the bare rule every new sample was silently left out of a
# commit (gini.samples._l2, which four apps import, would have been) while the files that
# had been force-added kept tracking, so nothing looked wrong until an import failed.
!ext/gini/
pox/lib/pxpcap/pxpcap_c/build
pox/lib/pxpcap/pxpcap_c/WpdPack
pox/lib/pxpcap/pxpcap.so
pypy/
*.class
*.conf
*.leases
*.bak
